# Keep cross-platform contract inputs and source files byte-stable.  In
# particular, the P0 fixture hash is defined over LF-delimited UTF-8 JSON;
# otherwise a Windows checkout can silently turn it into CRLF and make the
# iOS/Android parity gates disagree about the same fixture.
*.json text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.dart text eol=lf
*.swift text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
